{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>Your fullness and your tears you shall not delay.</b> This comes to warn concerning the terumah of wine and oil, for the word מלאתך is the name of the liquid that comes forth from the grapes, in the manner of what is written (Numbers 18:27) ״וכמלאה מן היקב״; and the word ודמעך is the name of the liquid that comes forth from the olives by means of pressing and crushing, like a tear (דמעה) that comes forth from the eye — therefore it is called דמעך."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:03:08.289316446Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}